BT /F2 16 Tf 54 564 Td (Chapter I.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 523.4 Td (It is a truth universally acknowledged, that a single man in) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 508.4 Td (possession of a good fortune must be in want of a wife.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 485.9 Td (However little known the feelings or views of such a man may be on) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 470.9 Td (his first entering a neighbourhood, this truth is so well fixed in) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 455.9 Td (the minds of the surrounding families, that he is considered as) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 440.9 Td (the rightful property of some one or other of their daughters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 418.4 Td (\223My dear Mr. Bennet,\224 said his lady to him one day, \223have you) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 403.4 Td (heard that Netherfield Park is let at last?\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 380.9 Td (Mr. Bennet replied that he had not.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 358.4 Td (\223But it is,\224 returned she; \223for Mrs. Long has just been here, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 343.4 Td (she told me all about it.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 320.9 Td (Mr. Bennet made no answer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 298.4 Td (\223Do not you want to know who has taken it?\224 cried his wife,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 283.4 Td (impatiently.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 260.9 Td (\223You want to tell me, and I have no objection to hearing it.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 238.39999999999998 Td (This was invitation enough.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 215.89999999999998 Td (\223Why, my dear, you must know, Mrs. Long says that Netherfield is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 200.89999999999998 Td (taken by a young man of large fortune from the north of England;) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 185.89999999999998 Td (that he came down on Monday in a chaise and four to see the place,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 170.89999999999998 Td (and was so much delighted with it that he agreed with Mr. Morris) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 155.89999999999998 Td (immediately; that he is to take possession before Michaelmas, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 140.89999999999998 Td (some of his servants are to be in the house by the end of next) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 125.89999999999998 Td (week.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 103.39999999999998 Td (\223What is his name?\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 80.89999999999998 Td (\223Bingley.\224) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
