stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 594 Td (\223Is he married or single?\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 571.5 Td (\223Oh, single, my dear, to be sure! A single man of large fortune;) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 556.5 Td (four or five thousand a year. What a fine thing for our girls!\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 534 Td (\223How so? how can it affect them?\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 511.5 Td (\223My dear Mr. Bennet,\224 replied his wife, \223how can you be so) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 496.5 Td (tiresome? You must know that I am thinking of his marrying one of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 481.5 Td (them.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 459 Td (\223Is that his design in settling here?\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 436.5 Td (\223Design? Nonsense, how can you talk so! But it is very likely that) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 421.5 Td (he may fall in love with one of them, and therefore you must visit) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 406.5 Td (him as soon as he comes.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 384 Td (\223I see no occasion for that. You and the girls may go--or you may) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 369 Td (send them by themselves, which perhaps will be still better; for) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 354 Td (as you are as handsome as any of them, Mr. Bingley might like you) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 339 Td (the best of the party.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 316.5 Td (\223My dear, you flatter me. I certainly have had my share of beauty,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 301.5 Td (but I do not pretend to be anything extraordinary now. When a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 286.5 Td (woman has five grown-up daughters, she ought to give over thinking) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 271.5 Td (of her own beauty.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 249 Td (\223In such cases, a woman has not often much beauty to think of.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 226.5 Td (\223But, my dear, you must indeed go and see Mr. Bingley when he) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 211.5 Td (comes into the neighbourhood.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 189 Td (\223It is more than I engage for, I assure you.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 166.5 Td (\223But consider your daughters. Only think what an establishment it) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 151.5 Td (would be for one of them. Sir William and Lady Lucas are) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 136.5 Td (determined to go, merely on that account; for in general, you) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 121.5 Td (know, they visit no new comers. Indeed you must go, for it will be) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 106.5 Td (impossible for us to visit him, if you do not.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 84 Td (\223You are over scrupulous, surely. I dare say Mr. Bingley will be) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 69 Td (very glad to see you; and I will send a few lines by you to assure) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
