stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 594 Td (him of my hearty consent to his marrying whichever he chooses of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 579 Td (the girls--though I must throw in a good word for my little) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 564 Td (Lizzy.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 541.5 Td (\223I desire you will do no such thing. Lizzy is not a bit better) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 526.5 Td (than the others: and I am sure she is not half so handsome as) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 511.5 Td (Jane, nor half so good-humoured as Lydia. But you are always) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 496.5 Td (giving her the preference.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 474 Td (\223They have none of them much to recommend them,\224 replied he: \223they) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 459 Td (are all silly and ignorant like other girls; but Lizzy has) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 444 Td (something more of quickness than her sisters.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 421.5 Td (\223Mr. Bennet, how can you abuse your own children in such a way?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 406.5 Td (You take delight in vexing me. You have no compassion on my poor) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 391.5 Td (nerves.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 369 Td (\223You mistake me, my dear. I have a high respect for your nerves.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 354 Td (They are my old friends. I have heard you mention them with) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 339 Td (consideration these twenty years at least.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 316.5 Td (\223Ah, you do not know what I suffer.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 294 Td (\223But I hope you will get over it, and live to see many young men) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 279 Td (of four thousand a year come into the neighbourhood.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 256.5 Td (\223It will be no use to us, if twenty such should come, since you) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 241.5 Td (will not visit them.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 219 Td (\223Depend upon it, my dear, that when there are twenty, I will visit) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 204 Td (them all.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 181.5 Td (Mr. Bennet was so odd a mixture of quick parts, sarcastic humour,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 166.5 Td (reserve, and caprice, that the experience of three-and-twenty) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 151.5 Td (years had been insufficient to make his wife understand his) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 136.5 Td (character. Her mind was less difficult to develope. She was a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 121.5 Td (woman of mean understanding, little information, and uncertain) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 106.5 Td (temper. When she was discontented, she fancied herself nervous.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 91.5 Td (The business of her life was to get her daughters married: its) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 76.5 Td (solace was visiting and news.) Tj ET
endstream
