BT /F2 16 Tf 54 564 Td (Chapter II.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 523.4 Td (Mr. Bennet was among the earliest of those who waited on Mr.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 508.4 Td (Bingley. He had always intended to visit him, though to the last) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 493.4 Td (always assuring his wife that he should not go; and till the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 478.4 Td (evening after the visit was paid she had no knowledge of it. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 463.4 Td (was then disclosed in the following manner. Observing his second) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 448.4 Td (daughter employed in trimming a hat, he suddenly addressed her) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 433.4 Td (with,--) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 410.9 Td (\223I hope Mr. Bingley will like it, Lizzy.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 388.4 Td (\223We are not in a way to know what Mr. Bingley likes,\224 said her) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 373.4 Td (mother, resentfully, \223since we are not to visit.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 350.9 Td (\223But you forget, mamma,\224 said Elizabeth, \223that we shall meet him) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 335.9 Td (at the assemblies, and that Mrs. Long has promised to introduce) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 320.9 Td (him.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 298.4 Td (\223I do not believe Mrs. Long will do any such thing. She has two) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 283.4 Td (nieces of her own. She is a selfish, hypocritical woman, and I) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 268.4 Td (have no opinion of her.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 245.89999999999998 Td (\223No more have I,\224 said Mr. Bennet; \223and I am glad to find that you) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 230.89999999999998 Td (do not depend on her serving you.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 208.39999999999998 Td (Mrs. Bennet deigned not to make any reply; but, unable to contain) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 193.39999999999998 Td (herself, began scolding one of her daughters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 170.89999999999998 Td (\223Don\222t keep coughing so, Kitty, for heaven\222s sake! Have a little) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 155.89999999999998 Td (compassion on my nerves. You tear them to pieces.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 133.39999999999998 Td (\223Kitty has no discretion in her coughs,\224 said her father; \223she) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 118.39999999999998 Td (times them ill.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 95.89999999999998 Td (\223I do not cough for my own amusement,\224 replied Kitty, fretfully.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 80.89999999999998 Td (\223When is your next ball to be, Lizzy?\224) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
