stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 594 Td (Mrs. Bennet perhaps surpassing the rest; though when the first) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 579 Td (tumult of joy was over, she began to declare that it was what she) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 564 Td (had expected all the while.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 541.5 Td (\223How good it was in you, my dear Mr. Bennet! But I knew I should) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 526.5 Td (persuade you at last. I was sure you loved your girls too well to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 511.5 Td (neglect such an acquaintance. Well, how pleased I am! And it is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 496.5 Td (such a good joke, too, that you should have gone this morning, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 481.5 Td (never said a word about it till now.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 459 Td (\223Now, Kitty, you may cough as much as you choose,\224 said Mr.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 444 Td (Bennet; and, as he spoke, he left the room, fatigued with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 429 Td (raptures of his wife.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 406.5 Td (\223What an excellent father you have, girls,\224 said she, when the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 391.5 Td (door was shut. \223I do not know how you will ever make him amends) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 376.5 Td (for his kindness; or me either, for that matter. At our time of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 361.5 Td (life, it is not so pleasant, I can tell you, to be making new) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 346.5 Td (acquaintances every day; but for your sakes we would do anything.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 331.5 Td (Lydia, my love, though you are the youngest, I dare say Mr.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 316.5 Td (Bingley will dance with you at the next ball.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 294 Td (\223Oh,\224 said Lydia, stoutly, \223I am not afraid; for though I am the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 279 Td (youngest, I\222m the tallest.\224) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 256.5 Td (The rest of the evening was spent in conjecturing how soon he) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 241.5 Td (would return Mr. Bennet\222s visit, and determining when they should) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 54 226.5 Td (ask him to dinner.) Tj ET
endstream
